# Gunner (friendly Army): a heavy machine gunner. Bulky olive armour with an ink front plate, a steel ammo box on the
# back feeding a belt to a hip-held gun with a drum, a rounded helmet with a blue lamp visor and the blue chest band
# (its light cue). Holds the line and hoses the street.
name gunner
grid 5
size 18 17 38
slot body Olive
slot dark Ink
slot lamp AllyBlue
slot steel Steel
box 6 3 0 10 7 14 body
box 6 9 0 10 13 14 body
box 4 2 0 10 7 1 dark
box 4 9 0 10 14 1 dark
box 4 2 14 12 14 28 body
box 11 3 17 13 13 27 dark
box 1 4 15 4 12 26 steel
beam 3 12 20 10 14 18 0.6 steel
box 6 5 28 11 11 31 dark
ellipsoid 8.5 8 33 3.8 3.4 2.4 body
box 11 5 31 13 11 33 lamp
# Cue band round the chest, readable from every side.
box 3 1 23 13 15 24 lamp
box 9 14 19 14 17 23 dark
beam 9 15 21 18 15 21 1.1 steel
box 10 14 16 13 17 19 steel
pivot 8 8 0
# R20 animation segments (Soldier gait roles): legs from the hip, the hip gun (ArmR) from the grip, head at the neck.
part LegL 0 0 0 18 8 14 8 5 14
part LegR 0 8 0 18 14 14 8 11 14
part ArmR 8 14 15 18 17 24 10 14 23
part Head 0 3 28 18 13 38 8 8 28
